1
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:50,840
Did it go smoothly?

2
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,680
This Cheng Weimin...

3
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,920
used to be Xiang Nan's downline.

4
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,000
Now,

5
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,359
he wants to bring his own clients

6
00:01:59,359 --> 00:02:00,799
and partner with us.

7
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,280
But if he does that,

8
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:05,159
Xiang Nan definitely won't let him off.

9
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,760
So,

10
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,919
he wants to use us to eliminate Xiang Nan.

11
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,919
Xiang Nan is backed by Piyazi, though.

12
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:21,400
The reason Cheng Weimin wants our help

13
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,560
to get rid of Xiang Nan

14
00:02:22,639 --> 00:02:23,639
is that he's afraid later on,

15
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:26,120
Piyazi will come after him alone.

16
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:29,199
Now that he's reached out to us,

17
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:32,000
both Jiang Liye and Theerade

18
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:33,800
will become his backing.

19
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,879
If we cause such a massive stir,

20
00:02:40,039 --> 00:02:41,840
won't Mr. Theerade be displeased?

21
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,800
Hard to say.

22
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:47,120
Still, I think Theerade and Piyazi

23
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:48,960
are completely at odds.

24
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:49,919
Otherwise,

25
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,439
he wouldn't be working with us.

26
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:58,000
Cheng Weimin is right about one thing, though:

27
00:02:58,199 --> 00:03:01,439
Xiang Nan is our common enemy.

28
00:03:03,719 --> 00:03:04,879
Let's go. We'll talk in the car.

29
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:57,759
Brother Nan.

30
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,159
Bring Yang Xing up.

31
00:04:18,879 --> 00:04:19,439
Let go.

32
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,439
Don't move.

33
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,720
Once we get there,

34
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:39,439
if Cheng Weimin doesn't show up,

35
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,279
call him for me

36
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:45,279
and lure him out.

37
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,079
Got it.

38
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,920
I'm on Brother Nan's side now.

39
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,439
I'll definitely do what Brother Nan says.

40
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:53,680
Let's go.

41
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,480
We're already on our way.

42
00:05:20,879 --> 00:05:21,720
Where are your men?

43
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:22,639
Are they ready?

44
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:24,839
Good.

45
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,199
Don't worry.

46
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:28,920
Once it's done,

47
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:29,879
I'll wire the rest of the money

48
00:05:29,879 --> 00:05:31,319
straight to your account.

49
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:32,879
No need.

50
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:36,279
Your men only need to handle the others.

51
00:05:36,639 --> 00:05:38,560
As for Cheng Weimin,

52
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:41,600
he must die by my men's hands.

53
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,160
Fine.

54
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,160
Ma Jingrong and Cheng Weimin

55
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,839
are both heinous criminals.

56
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,360
Plus, now there's that

57
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,839
cold-blooded killer Xiang Nan.

58
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,079
I'm worried...

59
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:50,079
It's a simple mission. Don't worry.

60
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:10,079
Xiao Zhuang,

61
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,199
you must be careful.

62
00:08:14,959 --> 00:08:15,720
Don't worry.

63
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,720
I'll definitely bring him back in one piece.

64
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,120
Wait for me.

65
00:08:56,559 --> 00:08:58,759
After spending so much time with the two of you,

66
00:08:59,759 --> 00:09:01,159
I feel a real sense of closeness.

67
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:04,519
Siqi once told me in private

68
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,200
that when the time was right,

69
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:08,919
we'd go abroad together

70
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:11,600
and live like a real family.

71
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:15,320
All right. Let's go abroad together.

72
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:38,360
Xiao Zhuang,

73
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:41,679
today...

74
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,159
this is no ordinary operation.

75
00:09:44,639 --> 00:09:46,039
I know you can handle yourself,

76
00:09:46,279 --> 00:09:50,279
but stay clear if things go wrong.

77
00:09:50,759 --> 00:09:52,200
If anything happens to you,

78
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:56,720
I won't be able to face your wife.

79
00:09:57,639 --> 00:09:58,440
Stay clear?

80
00:09:59,519 --> 00:10:00,600
Can I really stay clear?

81
00:10:01,679 --> 00:10:02,759
Cheng Weimin...

82
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:05,320
doesn't he just want Xiang Nan dead by our hands?

83
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,200
Even so, you don't have to do it yourself.

84
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,679
I don't want Piyazi

85
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,879
to pin Xiang Nan's death on you.

86
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,000
I'm different.

87
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:19,720
Sooner or later, I'll have to face Piyazi anyway.

88
00:10:49,919 --> 00:10:50,879
How are things, Mr. Cheng?

89
00:10:51,799 --> 00:10:52,480
Everything is ready.

90
00:10:52,639 --> 00:10:55,279
Xiang Nan will never guess

91
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,840
that so many people are looking for me today.

92
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:59,039
He should already be on his way.

93
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,480
We should head out, too.

94
00:11:00,759 --> 00:11:01,279
All right.

95
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,679
Ma Jingrong and Cheng Weimin have agreed

96
00:11:22,799 --> 00:11:24,039
to eliminate Xiang Nan together.

97
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:24,919
Meanwhile, on Xiang Nan's side,

98
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,039
he wants to use Yang Xing to lure Cheng Weimin out.

99
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,279
This isn't a deal.

100
00:11:29,559 --> 00:11:30,360
It's a firefight.

101
00:11:30,559 --> 00:11:32,720
Operation Thunderbolt's Chief Liaison Bai Hua

102
00:11:32,879 --> 00:11:34,360
is the overall commander for our operation.

103
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:37,080
Captain Bai will assess the scene,

104
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,279
and to Team A, led by me,

105
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,720
Team B, led by Zhang Qiang,

106
00:11:40,159 --> 00:11:41,799
and Team C, comprising SWAT officers,

107
00:11:41,879 --> 00:11:42,519
issue all operational orders.

108
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:43,360
Captain Bai.

109
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,240
According to instructions from our superiors,

110
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,399
for this operation,

111
00:11:48,559 --> 00:11:50,440
our primary capture target is Cheng Weimin.

112
00:11:51,279 --> 00:11:52,960
As for Ma Jingrong and Xiang Nan,

113
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:55,159
during the course of the operation,

114
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:57,000
we need to create favorable conditions

115
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,000
so that we can let them get away,

116
00:11:58,159 --> 00:11:59,440
in order to ensure Operation Thunderbolt

117
00:11:59,679 --> 00:12:00,679
can proceed smoothly.

118
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:02,879
Because today's operation

119
00:12:02,919 --> 00:12:04,000
is of a unique and sensitive nature,

120
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:06,639
please make sure all officers are notified

121
00:12:06,759 --> 00:12:08,639
to remain on high alert

122
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:11,679
and follow my orders during the mission.

123
00:12:14,159 --> 00:12:16,120
If we're all set, let's move out.

124
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:17,480
You're the star of the show today.

125
00:13:28,399 --> 00:13:30,559
Once Yuan Hong captures Cheng Weimin,

126
00:13:30,679 --> 00:13:32,799
I'll make him hand over the client files.

127
00:13:33,919 --> 00:13:35,440
Then you kill him.

128
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:04,480
Call Boss Cheng.

129
00:14:04,919 --> 00:14:05,399
Got it.

130
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:30,600
Boss Cheng.

131
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:33,399
Boss Yang, long time no see.

132
00:14:34,039 --> 00:14:34,600
Long time no see.

133
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,120
Counting this shipment,

134
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:46,039
you owe me 1.8 million in total.

135
00:14:48,039 --> 00:14:48,759
Where's my money?

136
00:14:50,759 --> 00:14:51,679
The money's in my car.

137
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:53,440
I'll have someone bring it over now.

138
00:14:59,639 --> 00:15:00,360
Bring the money over.

139
00:15:02,039 --> 00:15:02,639
Drive.

140
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:08,879
Be right there.

141
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:34,679
Brother Nan, what are you doing here?

142
00:15:35,279 --> 00:15:37,360
Long time no see, brother.

143
00:15:37,919 --> 00:15:39,159
I've really missed you.

144
00:15:39,799 --> 00:15:41,679
Brother Nan, don't say that.

145
00:15:41,919 --> 00:15:43,519
You're scaring me.

146
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:45,279
I'm terrified.

147
00:15:49,159 --> 00:15:50,759
Have you always wanted to see me

148
00:15:50,759 --> 00:15:52,080
looking this terrified?

149
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:54,360
Did you really think

150
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:55,360
that in front of you,

151
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:57,000
I, Cheng Weimin, am just a nobody?

152
00:15:58,799 --> 00:16:00,600
Bringing just two guys to kill me?

153
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,879
Do you think I'm stupid?

154
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,320
Ma Jingrong.

155
00:16:17,399 --> 00:16:18,240
Don't be surprised.

156
00:16:18,919 --> 00:16:20,480
Didn't you want to kill me?

157
00:16:20,559 --> 00:16:21,279
Here I am.

158
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,519
I bet you never thought

159
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,519
you'd fall into our hands, did you?

160
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:50,879
I really underestimated you.

161
00:16:51,679 --> 00:16:53,720
But it's too early to tell who'll win.

162
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:55,240
Ladies and gentlemen,

163
00:17:13,759 --> 00:17:14,559
All units, be advised.

164
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:17,440
Both groups of suspects have now appeared.

165
00:17:17,599 --> 00:17:18,799
Team C, prepare to move.

166
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:19,279
Copy that.

167
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,400
Give me Team C's full area map.

168
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:25,799
Yes, sir.

169
00:17:45,039 --> 00:17:46,640
Looks like with the way things stand,

170
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:49,119
the odds aren't really in your favor.

171
00:17:50,359 --> 00:17:53,480
How about this: hand over the client files,

172
00:17:53,839 --> 00:17:55,039
and we'll go our separate ways.

173
00:17:55,119 --> 00:17:56,880
I know you all too well.

174
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,680
At worst, we all go down together.

175
00:17:59,079 --> 00:18:01,000
Let's see who walks out of here alive today!

176
00:18:11,799 --> 00:18:13,240
Team C, move in.

177
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:43,119
The cops are here! Let's go!

178
00:18:57,359 --> 00:18:58,640
Xiao Zhuang, run!

179
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:40,079
You are surrounded by police!

180
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:42,640
Drop your weapons and surrender!

181
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:55,839
Captain Bai! Captain Bai!

182
00:19:56,880 --> 00:19:58,039
Brother Nan, get in!

183
00:20:01,279 --> 00:20:02,400
Out of the way!

184
00:20:26,519 --> 00:20:27,680
Brother Ma, head upstairs.

185
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:54,759
Brother Ma, let's go!

186
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:07,759
Let's go.

187
00:21:41,319 --> 00:21:42,680
Brother Ma, run!

188
00:21:42,759 --> 00:21:43,240
Go!

189
00:22:01,119 --> 00:22:01,880
Put the gun down!

190
00:22:03,599 --> 00:22:04,200
Drop the gun!

191
00:22:04,559 --> 00:22:05,160
Don't move!

192
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:10,480
Drop your weapon!

193
00:22:23,119 --> 00:22:23,559
Captain Bai,

194
00:22:24,240 --> 00:22:25,400
Ma Jingrong and Four-Legged Snake

195
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:27,119
have escaped through the exit we arranged.

196
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:29,240
Keep up the pursuit.

197
00:22:29,319 --> 00:22:30,480
Don't make it too easy for them.

198
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:31,519
Copy that.

199
00:22:56,359 --> 00:22:56,839
Keep chasing them!

200
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:57,319
Yes, sir!

201
00:23:02,599 --> 00:23:03,440
We're by the river right now.

202
00:23:04,880 --> 00:23:07,079
Meet us at the Oasis Avenue intersection in a bit.

203
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:07,880
Got it.

204
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:10,920
Who are you calling?

205
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:11,440
Xiaobai.

206
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:13,480
Brother Ma, look out!

207
00:23:53,079 --> 00:23:53,559
Captain Bai.

208
00:23:54,319 --> 00:23:54,799
Director Yan.

209
00:23:55,079 --> 00:23:55,839
How is the situation?

210
00:23:56,119 --> 00:23:57,440
Today's operation went very smoothly.

211
00:23:57,680 --> 00:23:59,960
Operation Thunderbolt should be able to move forward.

212
00:24:05,359 --> 00:24:05,720
Reporting:

213
00:24:06,279 --> 00:24:07,599
Seven suspects were killed on-site,

214
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:09,480
and six injured, including Cheng Weimin.

215
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:10,640
Ma Jingrong and Xiang Nan

216
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:11,599
escaped with two others.

217
00:24:11,720 --> 00:24:13,000
Zero casualties on our side.

218
00:24:14,440 --> 00:24:14,960
Good.

219
00:24:19,839 --> 00:24:21,279
In the earlier Nanhai drug case,

220
00:24:21,279 --> 00:24:23,200
many questions remain unanswered.

221
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:25,720
Cheng Weimin must be

222
00:24:25,759 --> 00:24:26,400
the key to unraveling them.

223
00:24:30,119 --> 00:24:31,799
I'll have officers keep eyes on him at the hospital.

224
00:24:32,200 --> 00:24:34,359
We'll interrogate him once he's out of danger.

225
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:35,400
Thank you, Director Yan.

226
00:24:38,319 --> 00:24:39,400
You rascal,

227
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:41,359
had your fill of living out a Hollywood blockbuster today?

228
00:24:43,680 --> 00:24:45,200
I only watch domestic cop films.

229
00:24:46,160 --> 00:24:46,680
Captain Bai.

230
00:24:59,160 --> 00:25:00,319
Weren't you going to meet the buyer?

231
00:25:00,319 --> 00:25:01,519
How did it end up like this?

232
00:25:02,559 --> 00:25:04,160
The cops are looking for us. Let's talk inside.

233
00:25:04,519 --> 00:25:06,200
I told you not to come back.

234
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:08,319
It's fine. Nothing happened anyway.

235
00:25:10,240 --> 00:25:13,160
Tonight, we'll switch hotels under new identities.

236
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,559
Someone on Cheng Weimin's end

237
00:25:17,759 --> 00:25:18,559
must have screwed up.

238
00:25:20,039 --> 00:25:22,720
I told you before the cops were after him.

239
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:24,680
Working with him was too risky.

240
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:25,720
You're right.

241
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:27,920
That's on me.

242
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:29,400
I was too impatient.

243
00:25:30,599 --> 00:25:32,519
Now that Cheng Weimin is in police hands,

244
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:35,000
a lot of people in his network will go down.

245
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,160
Looks like on this trip,

246
00:25:40,119 --> 00:25:42,079
we won't finish the mission Theerade gave us.

247
00:25:42,559 --> 00:25:45,319
I think we need to take this business slow.

248
00:25:46,119 --> 00:25:48,240
What worries me most now is Xiang Nan.

249
00:25:49,279 --> 00:25:50,279
If he finds out

250
00:25:51,119 --> 00:25:53,160
we allied with Cheng Weimin against him,

251
00:25:53,599 --> 00:25:54,480
then tracking us down

252
00:25:54,759 --> 00:25:55,920
will be a piece of cake for him.

253
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:01,319
Don't worry. Everything is under control.

254
00:26:34,039 --> 00:26:35,359
The police will find us soon.

255
00:26:35,680 --> 00:26:36,920
We need to get back to Country M fast.

256
00:26:38,559 --> 00:26:40,359
We should've taken out Ma Jingrong sooner.

257
00:26:41,240 --> 00:26:43,119
Didn't expect him to strike first.

258
00:26:43,359 --> 00:26:45,519
The cops have probably busted all of them by now.

259
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:49,640
They're lucky to end up in police hands.

260
00:27:10,480 --> 00:27:12,480
There's something I find strange.

261
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:16,000
I only agreed with Cheng Weimin

262
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:17,319
on the meeting place this morning.

263
00:27:18,319 --> 00:27:20,440
How did the cops find out so fast?

264
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:22,599
Cheng Weimin has so many men under him.

265
00:27:22,839 --> 00:27:24,599
There might be a police mole among them.

266
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:27,240
You've got a point.

267
00:27:28,359 --> 00:27:29,599
But I've also been wondering...

268
00:27:30,359 --> 00:27:31,640
Could this mole you're talking about

269
00:27:31,799 --> 00:27:33,240
be one of us?

270
00:27:34,200 --> 00:27:35,039
You suspect Brother Four?

271
00:27:35,559 --> 00:27:36,400
No way.

272
00:27:37,559 --> 00:27:39,400
Four-Legged Snake has blood on his hands.

273
00:27:39,720 --> 00:27:41,000
How could it be him?

274
00:27:41,440 --> 00:27:42,920
Did I ever tell you

275
00:27:43,839 --> 00:27:45,279
that I used to be a mercenary?

276
00:27:47,119 --> 00:27:48,799
No wonder you're so skilled, Brother Nan.

277
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:51,279
Then did I ever tell you

278
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:55,279
that I know Morse code pretty well, too?

279
00:28:06,319 --> 00:28:08,119
Looks like I should be thanking you.

280
00:28:08,680 --> 00:28:10,480
The only reason I escaped today

281
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:11,759
was because the cops wanted you

282
00:28:11,920 --> 00:28:13,200
to stay undercover by my side,

283
00:28:13,319 --> 00:28:15,480
so you could get close to my boss, right?

284
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:33,480
How much does a cop make a month?

285
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:34,720
Risking your life like this...

286
00:28:35,240 --> 00:28:36,000
Is it worth it?

287
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:37,359
I don't want to risk my life either.

288
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:39,000
But if my life

289
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:42,359
means fewer scumbags like you in this world,

290
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:43,799
even if I die,

291
00:28:44,279 --> 00:28:45,279
it'll all be worth it.

292
00:28:50,559 --> 00:28:53,319
Go on, shoot!

293
00:28:53,799 --> 00:28:55,519
At this speed, the moment you fire,

294
00:28:55,680 --> 00:28:56,480
this car will spin out of control.

295
00:28:56,799 --> 00:28:58,880
If you don't die, you'll be crippled.

296
00:28:59,119 --> 00:29:01,119
The police will definitely catch you.

297
00:29:06,759 --> 00:29:10,000
100 million. We go our separate ways.

298
00:29:18,079 --> 00:29:19,000
You're right.

299
00:29:19,960 --> 00:29:21,480
Cops don't make much money.

300
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:24,440
We undercover cops risk life and limb,

301
00:29:25,039 --> 00:29:26,319
on edge every single day.

302
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:27,400
One single slip-up,

303
00:29:27,559 --> 00:29:29,319
and we could die at the hands of our own men.

304
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:30,839
But there is one thing

305
00:29:31,960 --> 00:29:34,079
that remains an absolute truth:

306
00:29:35,440 --> 00:29:36,480
Cops catch criminals.

307
00:29:37,319 --> 00:29:38,480
Plain and simple.

308
00:30:13,839 --> 00:30:15,200
The cops are here! Let's go!

309
00:30:57,039 --> 00:30:58,319
Actually, you didn't kill Xiang Nan

310
00:30:59,599 --> 00:31:01,359
just to work with Cheng Weimin,

311
00:31:01,359 --> 00:31:01,799
did you?

312
00:31:05,559 --> 00:31:07,359
All my brothers in Nanhai

313
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:09,599
died at Xiang Nan's hands.

314
00:31:12,119 --> 00:31:14,359
If that mad dog stayed alive,

315
00:31:15,200 --> 00:31:17,119
he'd never stop coming after me.

316
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:39,240
Alright, got it.

317
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:42,319
No.

318
00:31:44,039 --> 00:31:45,039
Get out of here right now.

319
00:31:45,319 --> 00:31:47,200
Come back once we take care of business.

320
00:31:49,480 --> 00:31:50,079
Okay.

321
00:31:58,000 --> 00:32:01,400
Lao Qin took care of Xiang Nan cleanly.

322
00:32:02,400 --> 00:32:05,279
From now on, in Jiangyang,

323
00:32:05,839 --> 00:32:08,920
no one can stop me.

324
00:32:17,279 --> 00:32:19,079
When did you notify Lao Qin?

325
00:32:31,480 --> 00:32:33,599
The day after meeting Cheng Weimin,

326
00:32:37,000 --> 00:32:38,680
I was just worried that

327
00:32:39,799 --> 00:32:43,240
if the warehouse wasn't fully cleaned up,

328
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:45,359
it'd come back to bite us.

329
00:32:46,440 --> 00:32:49,200
With Lao Qin there, I feel at ease.

330
00:32:56,640 --> 00:32:58,359
It's not that I don't trust you, Xiao Zhuang.

331
00:32:58,720 --> 00:33:01,400
I just don't want you getting involved in this.

332
00:33:06,279 --> 00:33:07,599
If you see me as a brother,

333
00:33:08,200 --> 00:33:09,440
you shouldn't hide anything from me.

334
00:33:14,640 --> 00:33:16,640
Fine, I promise you.

335
00:33:29,440 --> 00:33:31,200
The Jiangyang police are investigating us right now.

336
00:33:31,359 --> 00:33:32,680
Should we head back and lay low for a while?

337
00:33:35,640 --> 00:33:37,680
Theerade expects us to bring clients back with us.

338
00:33:37,880 --> 00:33:39,359
Right now, we're empty-handed.

339
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:41,599
We won't be able to answer to him.

340
00:33:46,400 --> 00:33:50,960
Too bad Cheng Weimin fell into police hands.

341
00:33:54,880 --> 00:33:55,559
Xiao Zhuang.

342
00:33:56,839 --> 00:34:01,359
You said you had some friends in Jiangyang too.

343
00:34:04,319 --> 00:34:05,640
I wouldn't really call them friends.

344
00:34:05,839 --> 00:34:07,119
Just people I've dealt with in business.

345
00:34:07,559 --> 00:34:08,599
But through them,

346
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:10,559
we should be able to find the people we need.

347
00:34:13,079 --> 00:34:15,920
Brother Ma, you're wanted by the police right now.

348
00:34:16,519 --> 00:34:17,679
They shouldn't be onto me yet.

349
00:34:18,119 --> 00:34:20,199
So just stay put here for now.

350
00:34:20,519 --> 00:34:22,960
Xiaobai and I will handle the clients.

351
00:34:25,039 --> 00:34:27,280
Didn't your wife want you out of this business?

352
00:34:28,039 --> 00:34:29,039
If she really didn't want me to,

353
00:34:29,199 --> 00:34:30,320
she wouldn't have come here with me.

354
00:34:31,039 --> 00:34:32,400
That's the power of love.

355
00:34:35,679 --> 00:34:36,440
Be careful.

356
00:34:37,800 --> 00:34:38,440
You got it.

357
00:35:23,480 --> 00:35:24,199
I thought

358
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:26,199
you could stay undercover,

359
00:35:27,280 --> 00:35:29,119
but things took an unexpected turn.

360
00:35:30,840 --> 00:35:32,280
After planning for so long,

361
00:35:34,199 --> 00:35:35,559
things still went wrong.

362
00:35:36,320 --> 00:35:37,400
No one expected

363
00:35:37,719 --> 00:35:40,320
Ma Jingrong to hire Qin Mu for a hit.

364
00:35:43,719 --> 00:35:45,199
Since it's come to this,

365
00:35:47,280 --> 00:35:50,440
your undercover mission ends now.

366
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:55,519
Captain Bai,

367
00:35:56,519 --> 00:35:59,599
I think sticking with Four-Legged Snake

368
00:35:59,719 --> 00:36:01,079
can still get me close to Piyazi.

369
00:36:01,519 --> 00:36:03,199
No, it's too dangerous.

370
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:05,199
What kind of man Piyazi is,

371
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:06,400
you know better than I do.

372
00:36:06,760 --> 00:36:08,519
For profit and to cover his tracks,

373
00:36:08,679 --> 00:36:10,000
he'd kill even his own people.

374
00:36:10,239 --> 00:36:11,880
Not to mention Piyazi's brother

375
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:13,679
died while he was with you.

376
00:36:14,199 --> 00:36:15,480
He will never let you off the hook.

377
00:36:15,639 --> 00:36:16,800
Operation Thunderbolt

378
00:36:16,960 --> 00:36:18,800
has come this far with great effort.

379
00:36:19,119 --> 00:36:20,559
We've sacrificed so much

380
00:36:20,719 --> 00:36:22,119
to get to this stage.

381
00:36:22,960 --> 00:36:24,480
I can't let my own safety

382
00:36:24,599 --> 00:36:25,840
ruin the whole operation.

383
00:36:26,280 --> 00:36:28,760
You know how dangerous undercover work is.

384
00:36:29,079 --> 00:36:30,400
I want you to stay alive.

385
00:36:30,719 --> 00:36:31,599
But if I don't go—

386
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:32,760
No buts.

387
00:36:38,519 --> 00:36:40,599
Our investigation into Piyazi won't stop,

388
00:36:40,760 --> 00:36:42,480
and Operation Thunderbolt will continue.

389
00:36:42,639 --> 00:36:43,360
Do you understand?

390
00:36:45,039 --> 00:36:46,360
Ma Jingrong hired a hitman.

391
00:36:46,519 --> 00:36:48,239
Piyazi definitely won't spare him.

392
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:50,440
I know you planted someone with Ma Jingrong,

393
00:36:50,440 --> 00:36:51,039
but...

394
00:36:51,239 --> 00:36:52,800
That makes it even more crucial

395
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:55,280
to infiltrate Piyazi's ring for intel.

396
00:36:58,880 --> 00:37:00,119
A cross-border undercover mission is too risky.

397
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:01,639
I have to report to higher-ups first.

398
00:37:03,480 --> 00:37:05,719
I know going with Four-Legged Snake to see Piyazi

399
00:37:06,320 --> 00:37:07,519
carries immense danger.

400
00:37:07,760 --> 00:37:09,039
But I am a police officer.

401
00:37:09,559 --> 00:37:11,360
Captain Bai, I'm your comrade.

402
00:37:12,960 --> 00:37:14,360
You have to trust me.

403
00:37:15,079 --> 00:37:16,679
I can get the job done.

404
00:37:29,559 --> 00:37:30,840
It's a call from Four-Legged Snake.

405
00:37:31,639 --> 00:37:32,599
You're my superior.

406
00:37:32,960 --> 00:37:35,800
I need your approval to continue the operation.

407
00:38:00,199 --> 00:38:01,960
Brother Four, where are you?

408
00:38:03,199 --> 00:38:04,960
Alright, see you in a bit.

409
00:38:13,159 --> 00:38:13,800
Captain Bai.

410
00:38:15,280 --> 00:38:16,159
I'm heading out.

411
00:38:18,800 --> 00:38:19,639
Wei Kai.

412
00:38:21,079 --> 00:38:22,679
Once the operation is over,

413
00:38:27,360 --> 00:38:29,639
I want to see you in your uniform,

414
00:38:31,559 --> 00:38:33,119
standing in front of me.

415
00:39:12,920 --> 00:39:13,679
Where's Brother Nan?

416
00:39:16,599 --> 00:39:17,960
I asked you, where's Brother Nan?

417
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:21,480
Brother Nan is dead.

418
00:39:23,039 --> 00:39:23,760
What?

419
00:39:24,719 --> 00:39:26,199
Brother Nan is dead.

420
00:39:26,360 --> 00:39:28,239
I clearly saw the two of you get out together!

421
00:39:28,599 --> 00:39:30,599
We did break through the police blockade,

422
00:39:31,239 --> 00:39:33,800
but we ran into a bunch of gunmen on the road.

423
00:39:33,960 --> 00:39:36,000
What? What gunmen?

424
00:39:38,199 --> 00:39:39,519
Those guys came out of the cargo hold

425
00:39:39,519 --> 00:39:40,320
and tailed us.

426
00:39:40,480 --> 00:39:42,119
They shot Brother Nan dead.

427
00:39:42,599 --> 00:39:43,320
Who were they?

428
00:39:44,119 --> 00:39:45,079
Who were they?!

429
00:39:45,239 --> 00:39:47,320
I don't know. I've never seen them before.

430
00:39:51,199 --> 00:39:52,840
But they looked like they were from Country M.

431
00:39:53,519 --> 00:39:54,960
If I'm not mistaken,

432
00:39:55,519 --> 00:39:57,440
Ma Jingrong hired them to do it.

433
00:39:58,920 --> 00:40:00,480
Ma Jingrong?

434
00:40:11,360 --> 00:40:12,440
Now that things have blown up like this,

435
00:40:12,480 --> 00:40:14,079
the cops are definitely looking everywhere for us.

436
00:40:14,639 --> 00:40:17,639
Before, we could still lay low in Country M,

437
00:40:18,519 --> 00:40:20,000
but now Brother Nan is dead.

438
00:40:32,960 --> 00:40:33,639
Brother Nan.

439
00:40:34,599 --> 00:40:37,519
I kept telling you to go back to Country M,

440
00:40:37,519 --> 00:40:39,199
but you just wouldn't listen.

441
00:40:40,599 --> 00:40:42,719
You insisted on avenging our brothers,

442
00:40:43,920 --> 00:40:46,599
and called me, Four-Legged Snake, a coward.

443
00:40:48,840 --> 00:40:51,280
So much for my good intentions.

444
00:40:51,639 --> 00:40:52,920
Just as I expected,

445
00:40:53,480 --> 00:40:54,559
you got taken out.

446
00:40:55,400 --> 00:40:57,760
You're Brother Dong's favorite little brother.

447
00:40:57,920 --> 00:40:58,840
Now that you're gone,

448
00:40:59,159 --> 00:41:01,559
how can I explain this to Brother Dong?

449
00:41:01,840 --> 00:41:03,079
All we can do is go to Country M

450
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:06,480
and explain it to Brother Dong in person.

451
00:41:08,360 --> 00:41:10,679
Unless we have another choice.

452
00:41:17,679 --> 00:41:19,639
What other choice could I have?

453
00:41:20,559 --> 00:41:24,000
If I don't explain this clearly to Brother Dong,

454
00:41:30,199 --> 00:41:32,599
I'll be on the run for the rest of my life.

455
00:41:41,599 --> 00:41:43,199
None of Ma Jingrong's past downline buyers

456
00:41:43,480 --> 00:41:44,400
has ever been able

457
00:41:44,559 --> 00:41:46,320
to move hundreds of millions in cargo yearly.

458
00:41:46,880 --> 00:41:48,199
That's why he reached out to Cheng Weimin.

459
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:50,800
Now that Cheng Weimin has been caught,

460
00:41:51,079 --> 00:41:53,159
Ma Jingrong can't answer to Theerade.

461
00:41:54,280 --> 00:41:55,920
Then Theerade could easily cast him aside.

462
00:41:56,159 --> 00:41:58,239
Unless we find him a capable

463
00:41:58,400 --> 00:41:59,559
and influential downline buyer.

464
00:41:59,920 --> 00:42:01,639
Otherwise, all our planning

465
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:02,960
will have been in vain.

466
00:42:05,199 --> 00:42:07,039
I think this is actually our chance.

467
00:42:07,199 --> 00:42:08,760
If Theerade's downline buyer

468
00:42:08,920 --> 00:42:10,440
happens to be one of our own,

469
00:42:10,599 --> 00:42:11,840
then in future operations,

470
00:42:12,000 --> 00:42:13,840
we'll hold far more initiative.

471
00:42:14,639 --> 00:42:16,920
Ma Jingrong is suspicious by nature.

472
00:42:17,199 --> 00:42:18,480
If we suddenly

473
00:42:18,679 --> 00:42:20,400
bring in such a major buyer for him,

474
00:42:20,760 --> 00:42:22,000
he'll definitely get suspicious.

475
00:42:22,880 --> 00:42:24,159
A downline buyer...

476
00:42:25,639 --> 00:42:26,639
How about this?

477
00:42:27,840 --> 00:42:29,079
We set them up with

478
00:42:29,239 --> 00:42:30,599
a drug dealer who actually exists.

479
00:42:34,239 --> 00:42:35,719
Earlier, the Zhuwan Narcotics Detachment

480
00:42:35,760 --> 00:42:36,840
in a covert operation

481
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:38,960
captured a drug dealer named Shen Xinru.

482
00:42:39,719 --> 00:42:42,079
This dealer is infamous in the drug trade,

483
00:42:42,280 --> 00:42:43,360
but his movements are elusive.

484
00:42:43,519 --> 00:42:45,239
Few people know what he actually looks like.

485
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:47,599
You mean

486
00:42:48,280 --> 00:42:50,800
have someone pose as Shen Xinru?

487
00:42:51,480 --> 00:42:53,199
Theerade will surely use other channels

488
00:42:53,440 --> 00:42:55,159
to check Ma Jingrong's downline buyer.

489
00:42:55,280 --> 00:42:56,760
If we want him to take the bait,

490
00:42:57,800 --> 00:42:59,519
we could find someone

491
00:42:59,639 --> 00:43:01,360
who shares Shen Xinru's physical features.

492
00:43:04,320 --> 00:43:05,719
You know the case files inside out.

493
00:43:06,639 --> 00:43:09,000
Thanks to you keeping me off the field, Captain Bai.

494
00:43:11,400 --> 00:43:13,239
I need to run this by higher-ups.

495
00:43:13,800 --> 00:43:14,760
Wait for my word.

496
00:43:16,320 --> 00:43:16,960
Alright.
